course: dictionary
lesson: 10709
title: Untimely
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Untimely is built from two parts: un- means not, and timely means on time. So untimely means not on time. It can mean happening too soon, before the normal or expected time, or happening at a bad or unsuitable time.
explain: Context shows you which meaning fits. In «met an untimely end», the sentence is about death, so it means died young or died violently. In a phone call that comes just as you sit down to eat, the call is at the wrong moment, so it is an untimely call.
explain: Test your meaning by swapping it into the sentence. If you read «met an untimely end» as «met an end too soon», it still makes sense, so you have the right idea. If the meaning does not fit, read on and look for more clues.
fact: Untimely means happening too soon, before the normal or expected time.
fact: Untimely also means happening at a bad or unsuitable time.
fact: «Met an untimely end» means died young or died violently.
fact: In news and stories, «untimely death» is a gentle, formal way to say someone died young.
fact: In stories, an untimely event often hints at sadness or bad luck.
exercise: What does untimely mean? | *Happening too soon, before the expected time | Happening exactly on time | Very old and wise | Happening on a sunny day
exercise: «Met an untimely end» means what? | Moved to a new house | *Died young | Lost a game of cards | Won a big prize
exercise: Mum says the phone call came at an untimely moment, just as dinner was served. What does untimely suggest here? | Very quiet and calm | Planned weeks in advance | *At a bad, unsuitable time | Happy and very welcome
test: The word untimely has two parts. Which two parts make it up? | untime and ly | un and time | timel and y | *un- and timely
test: What does «an untimely interruption» mean? | A loud noise at night | A friendly surprise party | A very long pause in a game | *Happening at a bad or unsuitable time
exam: Which sentence uses untimely to mean someone died young? | *He met an untimely end at only thirty years old | She arrived on time for the bus | The untimely shop opened on Monday | The untimely film was very funny
